      {
        "text": "With Swallow Wings Gu he flies and shouts across the field, his voice covering the wolf howls; his low altitude flying is near master level, and he moves like a celestial horse that stronger foes cannot match for both speed and battle strength. When the turtleback myriad wolf king smashes a hole in the wall, he activates the Gu to race back, then grows a second pair of wings on his back and doubles his speed before joining Golden Coat Gu and Rainbow Transformation Gu.",
